esUXWOALLnGMBc4Bn5hBZY9Qd1OtiWktKfCiiHMpBkmcYs0fljO3r3j3eOXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWgZByZtv2u5N1r9-YD06JaMPxHJI0C2ue10ODxRT5zpw&oe=6B0F0B55"}, "display_name": "Beyondreal", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Beyondreal virtual offices - a collaboration space for teams in stunning locations.\n\n- whiteboarding as an entire location, \n- photorealistic full-body avatars with face recognition: be yourself,  just  upload your picture,\n- increase your productivity: use multiple screens, 3D tools, stickers, \n- create smart maps, show products and enrich your workflow,\n- use your VR headset or invite others via standard video streaming tools,\n- record and stream from multiple cameras,\n- work in impressive and exciting locations and have engaging and productive meetings,\n- make the space your own: brand and save your meeting space and reuse it at anytime,\n- connect  to your team and plan activities: play basketball, chess, chat next to the fireplace or even visit an art exhibition\u2026\n\nBuild greater things and have a better communication in Beyondreal virtual offices, which do not just give you a place to work, but immerse you in a engaging workflow.", "short_description": "Beyondreal is an enterprise collaboration suite that allow you to:\n- whiteboard with ease, use your corporate tools or Beyondreal self made applications, \n- create a space that you can save and reuse with multiple screens, 3D tools, stickers and much more,\n- use your full photorealistic body avatar, and face recognition to give presentations, create smart maps, show products, or play basketball and just relax and chat with a friend at the campfire."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beyondreal.life/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://beyondreal.life/terms-and-conditions/", "publisher_name": "Anasaea", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://beyondreal.life/", "category": "